<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">Dai-Chin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">1 Thesalonikah</para>
  <para style="toc1">THESALONIKAHEA veia Pawluha Cayuk Akcüknak</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Thesalonikah</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Thes</para>
  <para style="mt1">THESALONIKAHEA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Veia Pawluha Cayuk Akcüknak</para>
  <para style="imt">Pyenhlüma</para>
  <para style="ip">Thesalonikah mlüh cun Romah pe Maketawnih khawa mlühnua kyaki. Philipih mlüh käna Thesalonikah sangcim hin Pawluh naw a mdüiha sangcima kyaki. Cunüngpi, ivei am nghjawk se, Judah jumnak üng vanga yängkie Judah am niki khyangea ksunga Pawluh naw thangkdaw a sang hü mkeiki Judahe naw ngtäknak pawh lawkie. Pawluh cun Thesalonikah mlüh ceh ta lü Berea mlüha cit khaia ami sihlingnak. Pawluh cun Korintuh mlüh a pha käna, Thesalonikah Sangcima a mawngma cun ngkhahpüi lü a khüipüi Timotia vei üngkhyüh mthehnaka kca a yah.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Thesalonikah üng Pawluha Kca Yuk Akcüknak </char> hin acua veki khritjane jah mcuhmtheh lü ngjuktha a jah petnak betüa kyaki. Ami jumeinak ja mhläkphyanaka thanga phäh jenak ngthu jah mthehki. Ami hlawnga a ve üng a awmih a jah sümsak. Käna, Khritawa law be vaia mawng sangcim k’uma, “Khritawa am law be ham üng thikia jumeikie hin Ania lawpüi vaia angsäia xünnak yah hnga khawh acun he aw?” tia ngthähnake a jah msang be. Acun käna, Khritaw itia law be khai? Khritaw law be vai äpeinak am mtät lü khut ami bi nglät vaia Pawluh naw jah mthehki.</para>
  <para style="iot">Amawng Ktawie</para>
  <para style="io1">Pyenhlüma <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TH 1:1">1:1</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jenak mthehnak ja mküieinak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TH 1:2-3:13">1:2—3:13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khritjan awmih mthümhletnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TH 4:1-12">4:1-12</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khritawa law be vaia mawng mtheimthangnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TH 4:13-5:11">4:13—5:11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Akpäihnaka mthümhletnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TH 5:12-22">5:12-22</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khüpnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TH 5:23-28">5:23-28</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1"/>Pawluh, Tilah ja Timoti naw,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Ngs 17:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Thesalonikah mlüha veki Pa Pamhnam ja Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa sakhyangea veia,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Bäkhäknak ja dimdeihnak nami khana pha law se.<verse eid="1TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thesalonikahea jumeinak ja xünsak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2"/>Nangmi phäh alä se Pamhnam je na lü kami ktaiyü naküt üng jenak ka ning jah mtheh petki. <verse eid="1TH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3"/>Ihlawka nami jumnak nami xünsak üng ngdangki, nami mhläkphyanak naw ihlawka ning jah khüikhawmsaki, ja mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritaw üng ihlawka nami äpeinak ngkhängki ti cun ka ning jah sümki. <verse eid="1TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4"/>Kami be ja kami cinae aw, Pamhnam naw ning jah mhläkphya na lü a khyang vaia a ning jah xü päng ti cun kami ksingki. <verse eid="1TH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5"/>Thangkdaw nami veia kami sang law kcük üng, khyü nglung däk am ni lü Ngmüimkhya Ngcim ja johit am, käna ngkhängceknak üng kümbekia cangnak am kami lawpüiki. Nami hlawnga kami ve üng, nangmia dawnak vaia kami veki ti cun nami ksingki. <verse eid="1TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6"/>Nami khamei a dämda üngpi, Ngmüimkhya Ngcim üngkhyüh lawkia jekyainaka ngthu yah lü keimi ja Bawipa üng nami ngcukngkiki.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5-9">Ngs 17:5-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7"/>Akaijah hne ja Maketawnih hne üng jumeikiea phäh ami ngcukngkihnak vaia nami kyaki. <verse eid="1TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8"/>Bawipaa ngthu cun nangmi üngka naw ngthang hüki, Maketawnih hne ja Akaijah hne däka am ni lü, hnün naküt üng Pamhnam nami jumeinak cun ngthang hüki. Acunüng, keimia pyen vai i pi am hlü. <verse eid="1TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9"/>Nami veia kami law üng ihawkba nami jah dokham, xüngseikia Pamhnam kcanga khut bi khaia, <verse eid="1TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10"/>thihnak üngka naw tho be lü Pamhnama mlung sonak üngka naw jah küikyankia a Capa Jesuh — khankhaw üngka naw a Capaa law be vai mtätei lü juktuh nghlat ta lü nami ve cun acuna khyang he naw pyen ve u.<verse eid="1TH 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Thesalonikaha Pawluha khut bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1"/>Kami be ja kami cinae aw, nami veia kami law cen sungpyamnak am ni ti nami ksingki. <verse eid="1TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2"/>Thesalonikah mlüh am kami pha law ham üng, Philipih mlüha ihlawka ami jah yaihyün nghekanak cun nami ksingki. Aktäa jah ngtäkpüi kyaw u lü pi, mi Pamhnam naw amät üngkhyüh lawkia Thangkdaw ning jah mtheh vaia lingnak jah pe pängki. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-24">Ngs 16:19-24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:1-9">17:1-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3"/>Kami ning jah nghuinak hin am dawkia mkhyenak, am ngcingcaihkia ngaihnak ja limmanak üng ning jah mtheh am ni. <verse eid="1TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4"/>Pamhnam naw Thangkdaw pyen khaia a jah ümnaka mäiha, khyanga mlung jesaki am ni lü, khyanga mlungkyawng jah ksingki Pamhnam jesak vaia ni khut kami bi ve. <verse eid="1TH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5"/>Nami veia kami law üng, mhläknaka ngthu pyen lü kamvanaka ngthu sumei khaia am kami lawki ti cun angtea nami ksingki. Pamhnam hin kami saksi ni. <verse eid="1TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6"/>Nangmi naw pi ni se, akce naw pi ni se, ua jah mküiei vai pi am ktha na u nawng. <verse eid="1TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7"/>Khritawa ngsäa kba nami veia kthähei lü yah kyawki. Cunüngpi, nami veia kami law üng hniphnawi lü nu mat naw a naca a mceia mäiha kami ning jah mceiki. <verse eid="1TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8"/>Acunakyase, kami ning jah mhläkphyanak am Pamhnam üngkhyüh lawkia Thangkdaw däk am ni lü kami sak pi ning jah pet hlü awnga kami ngtünkie cen. Nangmi cun aktä se kami ning jah mhläkphya naki. <verse eid="1TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9"/>Ka benae aw, ihlawka bawngkha lü mi khüi cun nami ksingki. Ua khana pi ia khuikhanak käh a pha law vaia, amhnüp amthana khüi lü Pamhnam üngkhyüh lawkia Thangkdaw cun kami ning jah mthehki.<verse eid="1TH 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10"/>Nangmi jumeikiea khana ihlawka ngcingcaih, ngsungpyun lü mkat vai käh vekia kami ve cun, nangmi ja Pamhnam cun kami saksia nami kyaki. <verse eid="1TH 2:10"/><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11-12"/>Amäta Khankhaw Pe ja hlüngtainaka ning jah cehpüiki, Pamhnam jekyaisakia xünsak üng nami ve vaia, Pa mat naw a cae a jah vepüia kba, mat cima ning jah mcuhmcäi mhlawhmcah lü kami ve nami ksingki.<verse eid="1TH 2:11-12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13"/>Pamhnam üng aläa kami jenaka mawng ta: Pamhnama ngthu nami veia kami lawpüi üng ngja lü nami dodangki. Khyanga ngthu sawxata mäiha käh ngai lü Mhnama ngthua ngai lü, acun cun Pamhnama ngthu kcanga kya lü jumeiki nangmia khana Pamhnam naw khut a bia phäh ni. <verse eid="1TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14"/>Kami benae aw, Jesuh Khritaw yahei lü Judah khawa veki Pamhnama sangcimea veia thawnkia kba, nangmia veia pi thawn lawki. Judah khyange amimäta khyangmjü naw ami jah mkhuimkhaa kba, nangmi pi namimäta khyangmjü naw ning jah mkhuimkha ve. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5">Ngs 17:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15"/>Judahe cun Bawipa Jesuh ja sahma he jah hnim u lü keimi pi jah mkhuimkhakie. Ihlawka Pamhnam am jekyaisakie ni. Ihlawka khyang naküt jah mkeieikie ni. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Ngs 9:23</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:45">13:45</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 13:50">50</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:2">14:2</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 14:5">5</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 14:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:5">17:5</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 17:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:12">18:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16"/>Küikyannak jah pe khaia thangkdaw Khyangmjükce hea veia kami sang pi jah ngdüm hlüsak ktawihkie. Aläa mkhyenak ami pawh cen ahikba mkhyenak kümceisakie ni. Akpäihnaka ta, Pamhnama mlungsonak ami khana pha päng ve.<verse eid="1TH 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pawluh Thesalonikaha ceh tü vai ngaihki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17"/>Ka benae aw, pumsa üng asängca mi ngtai kyaw u lü pi, mlung kyawng üng ta am mi ngtai. Akhyang puma ning jah hmuh be vaia aktä se ning jah süm lü kami ktha nakie. <verse eid="1TH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18"/>Nami veia nghlat law be vaia kami yängki. Kamät kung pi nghngih vei law vaia ka ngtängki, Khawyam naw am na lawsak ve. <verse eid="1TH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19"/>Kami äpeinak, jekyainak ja mi Bawipa Jesuha law be üng a maa kami ngnängpangnaka mawng awhcahnak vai cun nangmi ni, khyang kce he am ni. <verse eid="1TH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20"/>Kami hlüngtainak ja kami jekyainak ta nangmi ni.<verse eid="1TH 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1"/>Acunüng, am khamei khawh ti u ngü se, Aten mlüha mät däk ve hüt vaia kami ngtünkie ni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:15">Ngs 17:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2"/>Pamhnama phäh keimi am atänga Khritawa mawng Thangkdaw sangki kami na Timoti kami tüih law. Ani naw ngjuktha ning jah pe lü nami jumeinak ning jah kuei se, <verse eid="1TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3"/>acunüng, ahina mkhuimkhanakea phäh u pi hnu da käh nghlat be khaia, acuna ngkhaw mkhuimkhanake cun mi phäha Pamhnama hlüei ni ti namimät naw nami ksingki. <verse eid="1TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4"/>Nami hlawnga kami ve üng, khuikhanak mi khamei khai ti lü kami ning jah mtheh. Acukba kunga pha lawki, acun cun nami ksingki. <verse eid="1TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5"/>Khawyam naw ning jah hlawhlep se, kami khüikhawmnak alapa a thawn vai naw na ähei se, am khamei khawh ti lü Timoti hin nami jumeinak ning jah ksing khaia ka tüih law ni.<verse eid="1TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6"/>Atuh ta Timoti nami vei üngka naw law be ve. Nami jumeinak ja nami mhläkphyanaka thang jah mtheh lawki. Keimi naw aktäa kami ning jah hmuh hlüa kba aktäa nami jah hmuh hlüa mawng pi jah mtheh lawki. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Ngs 18:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7"/>Acunakyase, benae aw, mpyenkse lü khuikhanak mjüküm kami khamei kyaw üngpi, nami jumeinak naw jah doeisak ve. <verse eid="1TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8"/>Bawipa üng nami ngkhängceka kcün üng keimi naw xünnak yah ve ung. <verse eid="1TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9"/>Atuh ta, nangmia phäh mi Pamhnam je na ve ung. Nangmi üng jekyainak kami taka phäh, a hmai maa jenak mtheh ve ung. <verse eid="1TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10"/>Akhyang puma mi nghmuh lü nami jumeinak üng hlü hamki akümcei law vaia, amhnüp amthana mlung kcang am kami ktaiyüki.<verse eid="1TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11"/>Mi Pamhnam ja mi Pa amät, ja mi Bawipa Jesuh naw nami veia kami lawnak thei vaia lam pyang se. <verse eid="1TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12"/>Keimia mhläkphyanak a dämduha kba, mat ja mat nami mhläkphyanak ja khyang naküt nami mhläkphyanak hin dämduh law bawkbawk khaia Bawipa naw pyang se. <verse eid="1TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13"/>Acukba ani naw ning jah kyansaisak khai. A khankhawngsäe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“A khankhawngsäe” ti hin “A khyang ngcime” ti lü pi sumeikie.</char></note> am atänga mi Bawipa Jesuh a kyum law be üng, mi Pamhnam ja mi Paa maa ngcingcaihnak ja kümbenak am nami ve khai.<verse eid="1TH 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Pamhnama hlüeia xüngsei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1"/>Ka benae aw, akpäihnaka ka ning jah mtheh hlü ta: Pamhnam jekyaisakia xüngsei ning kami veia nami ngthei pängki, acukba nami xüngsei pängki ni. Acuna kthaka nami xüngsei dämdäm vaia Bawipa Jesuha ngming üng kami ning jah nghui naki. <verse eid="1TH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2"/>Mcuhmthehnake naküt cun Bawi Jesuha Ana üng ning jah pet ti cun nami ksingki. <verse eid="1TH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3"/>Am dawkyakia hnunglanak hawihceh lü nami ngcingcaih vai Pamhnam naw ngja hlüki. <verse eid="1TH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4"/>Kpami naküt naw ihawkba a nghnumi üng ngcingcaih lü leisawng phyakia a awmihpüi vai ja, <verse eid="1TH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5"/>Pamhnam am ksingki khyang kseea mäiha käh hüipawm kawlaih vai cun ksing ua. <verse eid="1TH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6"/>U naw pi a Khritjanpüi limma mhleimhlak lü käh eiaw se. Ahlana ka ning jah mtheh päng, acukba mkhyenak pawhki cun Bawipa naw mkhuimkha law khai ti lü asayüa ning jah mtheh veng. <verse eid="1TH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7"/>Pamhnam naw mi mtuihmleh khaia a jah khü am ni, ngcingcaih khaia a jah khü ni. <verse eid="1TH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8"/>Acunakyase, ahina mtheinak mahkia khyang cun naw khyang mahki am ni. A Ngmüimkhya Ngcim ning jah pekia Pamhnam mahki ni.<verse eid="1TH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9"/>Nami püi mhläkphyanaka mawng ning jah yuk law vai am hlü. Ihawkba mat ja mat mhläkphyanak vai cun Pamhnam naw ning jah mthei pängki ni. <verse eid="1TH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10"/>Acun däk am ni, Maketawnih khawa veki benaea veia pi acukba nami biki. Acunakyase, ka benae aw, nami bi law dämdäm vaia ning jah nghui na veng. <verse eid="1TH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11"/>Ahlana ka ning jah mtheh pänga kba, dimyekia xünsei vaia mtunei lü, nami khut ngaih na lü, nami kut am khüikhawm ua. <verse eid="1TH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12"/>Acukba nami ve üng, am jumeikie naw ning jah leisawng acun he. Nami hlükaw a ve üng pi khyang kce he am jah ümpa na uki.<verse eid="1TH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bawipa lawnak be vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13"/>Ka benae aw, thi pängki he a mawng ngthungtak nami ksing vai ngja hlü veng. Acunüng va, äpeinak am takia kba am nami thüisei pukse khai. <verse eid="1TH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14"/>Jesuh cun thi lü tho beki tia kami jumki. Acuna kba ni Jesuh jumei lü thiki naküt cun Pamhnam naw Jesuh am atänga jah mtho be khaia pi mi jumki.<verse eid="1TH 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15"/>Atuh kami ning jah mtheimthang hin Bawipaa mtheimthangnak ni. Bawipa law bea mhnüp vei xüng lü mi veki mimi hin thi pängki he a maa am mi pha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:51">1Kor 15:51</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 15:52">52</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16"/>Ngthupetnak üng ngpyang law khai, khankhawngsä ngvaia kthai ve law khai, Pamhnama pung kthai ng’yüng law lü khankhaw üngka naw Bawipa amät kyum law be khai. Acunüng, Khritaw jumei lü thikie cun tho be ma khaie. <verse eid="1TH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17"/>Acun käna, acuna kcün üng mi xüngki mimi pi, amimi am atänga khawngmei am jah mkhäm law be se, khana mi Bawipa am mi ngkhyum khaie. Acunüng, Bawipa am atänga angsäia mi ve law khai. <verse eid="1TH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18"/>Acunakyase, ahina ngthu am mat naw mat mhlawhmcah ua.<verse eid="1TH 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ngcüngceia, Bawipa law be khai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1"/>Ka benae aw, acuna thawn law khaiea akcün ja mkaea mawng ning jah yuk law vai am hlü. <verse eid="1TH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2"/>Mpyukei mthana a lawa kba, Bawipaa Khawmhnüp pha law khai ti cun angsingtea nami ksingki he ni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mt 24:43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39">Lk 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:10">2Pit 3:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3"/>“Dimdeih ve, kyühei kse üng lät ni” ami ti k’um üng mpyaikia nghnumi na hmi hlü naw a huiheia kba, ami khana cimpyenak cun ahunata pha law khai. Acun üngka naw u pi am lät yah u. <verse eid="1TH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4"/>Cunüngpi, ka benae aw, acuna Mhnüp naw mpyukeia kba käh ami ning jah mcat vaia, nghmüp k’uma nami vekia am kya. <verse eid="1TH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5"/>Nangmi avan hin akvaia ca, kdeia naa nami kyaki. Mthana ca ja nghmüpa naa am mi kya. <verse eid="1TH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6"/>Acunakyase, khyang kce hea iheia kba käh ipei lü, xak lü sitih am mi na mtät vai u. <verse eid="1TH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7"/>Ipeikie cun mthana ni ami ih. Juhai eiawkie naw pi mthana ni ami mpyüi. <verse eid="1TH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8"/>Kdeia caa mi kyaki mimi ta mi mceiei vai hlüki. Jumeinak ja mhläkphyanak cun mkyang bawpnaka kba mi suiawi vai u. Küikyannak mi äpei cun mthi lukhüma kba mi ngbüng vai u. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Hesa 59:17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:13-17">Eph 6:13-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9"/>Pamhnam naw a mlunga sonak mi khamei khaia a jah xü am ni. Cunüngpi, Bawipa Jesuh Khritaw üngkhyüh küikyannak mi ka na khaia a jah xü ni. <verse eid="1TH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10"/>Mi xüng üng pi kyase, mi thih üng pi kyase, a law bea kcün üng, ani am atänga mi xüng khaia mi phäha thiki. <verse eid="1TH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11"/>Atuh nami vea kba, mat naw mat mcuhmcäi lü nami kpüikpak vai.<verse eid="1TH 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akpäihnak mcäinak ja hnuksetnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12"/>Kami benae aw, nami ksunga khut bi lü Khritjan xünsak üng ning jah mcuhmtheh thalamkie asükyüa nami jah leisawng vaia kami ning jah nghui naki. <verse eid="1TH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13"/>Ami khut bi dämkia kyase, däm säihkia leisawngnak ja mhläkphyanak am nami jah vepüi vai. Mat ja mat ngkhawtsengnak am ve ua.<verse eid="1TH 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14"/>Ka benae aw, khyang kdame üng sitih jah pe ua. Kyükyawkeikie üng ktha jah pe u lü, ktha ngcekie jah kpüi ua. Khyang naküta veia mlung nami msaü vaia ning jah nghui na veng. <verse eid="1TH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15"/>Khyang naw akse a pawh üng, akse üng käh jah msak be ua. Mat ja mat, ja khyang vana veia aläa akdaw pawh vaia mkhüh na ua.<verse eid="1TH 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16"/>Aläa jekyai ua; <verse eid="1TH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17"/>Akcün tä lü ktaiyü ua. <verse eid="1TH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18"/>Ai a pha law üngpi jekyai ua. Khritaw Jesuh üng yümmat lü nami ve vai Pamhnam naw hlüei ve.<verse eid="1TH 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19"/>Ngmüimkhya Ngcima khut käh dimsak ua; <verse eid="1TH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20"/>Sahmaea ngthu pyen käh yaihyünei ua. <verse eid="1TH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21"/>Anaküt cun mhnüt ma lü, akdaw dodang ua. <verse eid="1TH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22"/>Akse naküt hjawng u bä.<verse eid="1TH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23"/>Dimdeihnak jah pekia Pamhnam naw anaküt ning jah ngcingcaihsak se. Bawipa Jesuh Khritaw a law be üng, nami ngmüimkhya, mlung kyawng ja pumsa avan cun mkhyekatnak naküt üng a lät vaia ning jah msümcei se. <verse eid="1TH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24"/>Nangmi ning jah khüki cun sitihkia kya lü acukba ning jah pawh khai ni.<verse eid="1TH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25"/>Ka benae aw, kami phäha pi ktaiyü ua.<verse eid="1TH 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26"/>Ngcingcaihkia hnunat mhnamnak am jumeikie avan jah hnukset ua.<verse eid="1TH 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27"/>Ahina kca hin jumeiki naküta veia nami kheh vaia Khritawa ngming üng ning jah nghui na veng.<verse eid="1TH 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28"/>Mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa bäkhäknak nami khana ve se.<verse eid="1TH 5:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5"/>
</usx>
